WEBVTT

00:08.570 --> 00:15.770
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:08.570 --> 00:15.770
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

00:15.810 --> 00:22.520
Setsunai hodo mune utsu kagirinai kibou

00:15.810 --> 00:22.520
This unbounded hope that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

00:23.320 --> 00:31.120
Hakanasa wo masu hibi wo
irodoru wa kisetsu no kaze

00:23.320 --> 00:31.120
The days pass by, becoming more fleeting,
colored by the season's wind

00:31.160 --> 00:35.830
Kioku no kakera ga sawagidashita yo

00:31.160 --> 00:35.830
The fragments of memory started running wild

00:36.430 --> 00:44.830
Arinomama wo mitomete
haruka tsumuida hikari ga

00:36.430 --> 00:44.830
One more time, I want to hold the
spindle of far off light close to my breast,

00:44.880 --> 00:52.510
Kieru mae ni mou ichido
kono mune ni dakishimete

00:44.880 --> 00:52.510
Before it disappears, before
I accept the way things are now

00:54.590 --> 01:01.790
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:54.590 --> 01:01.790
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

01:01.790 --> 01:08.930
Mirai wo egaku ao ni kono te wo nobashite

01:01.790 --> 01:08.930
Hold out this hand to the blue-painted future

01:09.100 --> 01:16.230
Kasokushiteku sekai yo douka
yasashii mama de ite

01:09.100 --> 01:16.230
The world accelerates, please let it stay this kind

01:16.340 --> 01:23.840
Setsunai hodo mune utsu afuredasu negai

01:16.340 --> 01:23.840
This overflowing wish that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

01:32.050 --> 01:36.510
On that day, we ended up
going swimming at the beach.

01:36.860 --> 01:37.620
The beach?

01:39.330 --> 01:40.530
You mean Yuigahama?

01:40.530 --> 01:41.430
Yes.

01:41.430 --> 01:44.300
I was invited by Satsuki and the others.

01:44.300 --> 01:47.400
I'm so there! Let's go to the beach, okay?

01:47.400 --> 01:49.470
The summer has just begun,

01:49.470 --> 01:52.240
so be careful not to get sunburned
or you'll regret it later.

01:52.240 --> 01:54.610
Take this suntan lotion.

01:55.880 --> 01:57.310
Thank you...

01:57.310 --> 01:59.980
Cellphones don't like saltwater.

01:59.980 --> 02:01.550
The beach!

02:01.550 --> 02:06.110
I'll lend you my watch, since it's waterproof.

02:07.290 --> 02:09.860
Thank you, Father.

02:09.860 --> 02:11.430
The beach!

02:11.430 --> 02:14.530
And be back before curfew. Got it, you two?

02:14.530 --> 02:15.600
We will...

02:15.600 --> 02:16.890
The beach!

02:18.630 --> 02:22.400
But at that beach where everyone gathered,

02:22.400 --> 02:25.530
I reunited with someone unexpected...

02:25.640 --> 02:30.140
The Heat of the Sandy Beach

02:33.050 --> 02:35.180
It's been a while for you too, right, Nao?

02:35.180 --> 02:37.880
Yeah... Not since I graduated
from elementary school.

02:38.190 --> 02:39.920
We're counting on you to show us around.

02:40.620 --> 02:43.520
It's not like I'm your tour guide...

02:45.160 --> 02:47.530
Honestly, I don't even want to go.

02:51.200 --> 02:54.040
This is my first time going to the beach!

02:54.040 --> 02:55.440
I can't wait!

02:55.770 --> 02:57.640
Good morning!

02:57.640 --> 02:59.410
Greetings, everyone.

02:59.410 --> 03:03.350
Hey, we're not at school,
you don't have to be so formal.

03:03.350 --> 03:04.240
I guess you're right!

03:04.550 --> 03:06.550
Ichika, who's that?

03:06.550 --> 03:08.050
Oh, she's...

03:08.050 --> 03:10.790
I'm Manatsu! Manatsu Kuroki!

03:10.790 --> 03:12.250
I'm a friend of Ichika's.

03:12.250 --> 03:13.150
Nice to meet you!

03:13.460 --> 03:15.190
Nice to meet you too.

03:15.190 --> 03:16.850
I'm Satsuki Takigawa.

03:17.790 --> 03:19.660
And I am Keiko Takamura.

03:19.660 --> 03:21.390
Please call me Keiko.

03:25.200 --> 03:27.070
Michuru Munakata.

03:28.300 --> 03:32.800
I'm stayin' at Ichika's place for the summer,
so let's be friends, 'kay?

03:32.840 --> 03:34.280
Roger!

03:34.710 --> 03:36.780
We'll be countin' on you, too!

03:36.780 --> 03:39.280
We decided that we're gonna
have fun this summer!

03:39.280 --> 03:40.810
Let's go, everyone.

03:42.680 --> 03:44.590
We're going to hang out on the beach,

03:44.590 --> 03:47.090
so isn't it kind of a bummer
to pass by the school?

03:47.090 --> 03:49.820
Oh, well... Shall we try going around?

03:50.130 --> 03:51.620
Thanks, but no thanks.

03:53.200 --> 03:54.990
She is a mysterious girl, yes?

03:55.600 --> 03:56.630
Manatsu.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.600
Y-you think?

03:58.600 --> 04:00.130
She's normal!

04:01.540 --> 04:03.600
Yes... I see.

04:04.270 --> 04:10.080
She has a keen intuition...
Michiru really is amazing.

04:11.480 --> 04:15.980
The beach!

04:16.590 --> 04:19.550
But man, it's so crowded!

04:19.550 --> 04:23.320
It'll be even more crowded
in the afternoon, definitely.

04:23.330 --> 04:25.460
Then now's our chance!

04:25.460 --> 04:27.430
Roger!

04:34.270 --> 04:36.200
Now, let's go!

04:37.240 --> 04:39.710
Oh, what about you, Michiru?

04:39.710 --> 04:44.270
My skin doesn't react well to salt water.

04:45.310 --> 04:50.380
Go on. I will watch everyone's things.

04:57.230 --> 05:00.460
I'm not so sure about going
in the ocean myself today.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.030
Okay, you guys hold down the fort.

05:06.030 --> 05:07.520
We'll make up for it later.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.330
Have fun!

05:09.810 --> 05:11.540
The beach!

05:11.540 --> 05:13.010
The sand is hot!

05:18.410 --> 05:21.220
So Nao, doesn't this bring back memories?

05:21.220 --> 05:22.550
Not really...

05:22.920 --> 05:24.150
This is the way.

05:24.450 --> 05:26.890
Hey, wait, Nao!

05:26.890 --> 05:28.690
Don't leave me behind!

05:33.330 --> 05:35.500
The water was great!

05:35.500 --> 05:37.270
Have a good time?

05:37.270 --> 05:39.270
It was great!

05:39.270 --> 05:41.870
You should totally go for a swim, Ichika.

05:41.870 --> 05:43.610
Sorry...

05:43.610 --> 05:45.070
What should we do for lunch?

05:45.940 --> 05:50.540
My brother's the manager
of that beach house, actually.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.210
Then tell us that earlier!

05:54.520 --> 05:56.640
Thanks for waiting!

05:56.950 --> 06:00.160
Here is your Bondi Frappé, and Red Ice.

06:00.160 --> 06:03.390
So, what does "Bondi" mean?

06:07.500 --> 06:09.000
That's...

06:09.000 --> 06:10.400
Something like...

06:10.400 --> 06:14.560
"Bondi" is the name of
a famous beach in Australia.

06:15.100 --> 06:16.070
Welcome!

06:17.510 --> 06:18.740
Hey!

06:18.740 --> 06:19.830
Go on, Michiru.

06:20.810 --> 06:23.010
It's a word in the local language that means

06:23.010 --> 06:25.000
"where the waves crash onto the rocks".

06:25.310 --> 06:28.550
Oh? It does make you think of the beach.

06:28.550 --> 06:29.720
You came?

06:29.720 --> 06:30.590
Yup!

06:30.590 --> 06:35.090
I was thinking I'd help increase
your beach house's sales.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.190
Thank you!

06:37.190 --> 06:40.630
But it's not any old beach house...
It's "Beachhouse Mariners!"

06:40.630 --> 06:43.220
You really like your names in English?

06:43.930 --> 06:44.960
Yeah...

06:48.640 --> 06:50.940
It looks like they get along really well.

06:50.940 --> 06:52.240
Yes, it does.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.040
Excuse me!

06:53.340 --> 06:55.310
Coming!

06:55.310 --> 06:57.550
Then, would you help me?

06:57.550 --> 06:58.610
Help?

06:58.610 --> 06:59.880
Help?
So we can shine more and more

06:59.880 --> 07:02.620
So we can shine more and more

07:02.620 --> 07:03.550
Let's walk out on a new path from here

07:03.550 --> 07:04.850
How cute...
Let's walk out on a new path from here

07:04.850 --> 07:11.380
Let's walk out on a new path from here

07:12.960 --> 07:17.030
Sorry, but I'm really short handed
during lunch time.

07:17.030 --> 07:19.630
Sheesh... Wrangling everyone into this...

07:19.630 --> 07:21.600
You'd better be paying us for this.

07:21.900 --> 07:22.890
Sorry...

07:23.770 --> 07:24.710
What's the matter?

07:24.710 --> 07:26.700
Some oil splattered...

07:29.340 --> 07:30.000
Salty...

07:30.310 --> 07:31.910
Want to switch with me?

07:46.060 --> 07:46.580
No...

07:47.900 --> 07:49.230
I'm okay.

07:50.600 --> 07:51.590
I see.

07:52.070 --> 07:52.830
Be careful.

07:53.470 --> 07:55.800
Thank you.

07:59.640 --> 08:01.010
Here, right?

08:01.010 --> 08:03.180
This must be the place with lots of cute girls.

08:03.180 --> 08:04.780
Boys will be boys.

08:04.780 --> 08:05.780
Seriously.

08:05.780 --> 08:07.440
Thank you for waiting!

08:07.450 --> 08:09.150
This is your yakisoba. It's hot, so take care.

08:09.150 --> 08:11.550
Tachibana and...
This is your yakisoba. It's hot, so take care.

08:12.850 --> 08:15.350
Let's go somewhere else, Eri.

08:15.660 --> 08:18.630
Thank you very much!

08:17.430 --> 08:19.230
We're over the peak...

08:19.230 --> 08:22.250
That's enough. Thanks a lot, everyone.

08:24.830 --> 08:26.530
Thank goodness.

08:29.500 --> 08:31.500
I bet you're all thirsty and hungry.

08:32.110 --> 08:34.700
Instead of paying you, I'll treat you all to lunch.

08:37.480 --> 08:41.950
We aren't allowed to do part-time jobs,
but this way it's no problem, right?

08:41.950 --> 08:44.420
You really are a stickler, Ichika.

08:45.820 --> 08:48.690
She doesn't seem like an evil spirit or anything...

08:48.690 --> 08:51.060
Michiru, did you say something?

08:51.460 --> 08:54.720
Eating after working makes
the food taste even better.

09:00.570 --> 09:02.560
One of those girls is quite interesting...

09:03.370 --> 09:06.140
I do hope she doesn't become
an obstacle to the trials.

09:16.050 --> 09:18.350
Helping out is over!

09:18.350 --> 09:21.620
He's holding on to our stuff,
so what should we do now?

09:21.620 --> 09:24.490
We've still got our lunch money,
so let's go somewhere!

09:24.490 --> 09:26.760
Yeah! Let's actually be customers this time.

09:29.060 --> 09:31.160
What's the matter, Michiru?

09:31.670 --> 09:35.230
Everyone's stomaches are quite...
full, aren't they?

09:40.040 --> 09:42.810
Well, swimming exercises the entire body!

09:42.810 --> 09:44.340
We'll digest in no time!

09:45.380 --> 09:46.640
Yup!

09:47.080 --> 09:50.140
I sure wish I was like Michiru
and didn't gain weight.

09:55.020 --> 09:58.150
I wonder if I have gastroptosis.

10:13.710 --> 10:16.140
Ichika, what time is it?

10:18.280 --> 10:20.300
It's past 3.

10:22.480 --> 10:24.510
Okay... I've had enough.

10:24.820 --> 10:26.990
I'm thirsty.

10:26.990 --> 10:28.290
Me, too.

10:28.290 --> 10:29.450
Then, let's go!

10:29.860 --> 10:31.590
Roger!

10:34.900 --> 10:37.370
Sure it's okay not to go to your brother's place?

10:37.370 --> 10:40.330
Let's be customers instead of family, okay?

10:40.340 --> 10:43.770
He treated us to lunch already,
we shouldn't impose any more.

10:43.770 --> 10:44.840
Yes.

10:44.840 --> 10:49.140
But, walking around near the school
in our swimsuits

10:49.140 --> 10:50.880
makes you kind of excited, you know?

10:50.880 --> 10:54.150
I bet we'd get an earful if a teacher caught us.

10:54.150 --> 10:58.650
Walking along the road in this outfit
is kind of embarrassing.

10:59.720 --> 11:02.020
Really? But everyone does it.

11:07.730 --> 11:10.330
Tachibana and...

11:10.330 --> 11:11.660
Shimizu!

11:12.930 --> 11:15.240
Her name is Nao Shimizu.

11:15.240 --> 11:20.370
She was my friend in elementary school,
but moved far away.

11:22.240 --> 11:26.110
Oh, so you went to the same
elementary school as Nao, Tachibana?

11:26.410 --> 11:27.180
Yes.

11:27.180 --> 11:29.280
Nice to meet you, Tachibana.

11:29.280 --> 11:31.810
I'm Kouji, and this is Masataka.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.790
H-hello.

11:33.790 --> 11:35.490
I'm Manatsu!

11:35.490 --> 11:38.080
Don't Kouji. You don't have a chance...

11:42.430 --> 11:47.300
These girls all go to this famous
academy for rich girls.

11:51.610 --> 11:53.040
Shimizu...

11:55.280 --> 11:59.780
Oh, right. You wanted to go
to our school, didn't you?

11:59.880 --> 12:00.910
So that's why...

12:01.620 --> 12:02.880
Satsuki!

12:03.890 --> 12:05.410
I remember.

12:06.090 --> 12:08.110
I saw you during the entrance exams.

12:08.690 --> 12:10.590
But I guess you didn't make it.

12:11.230 --> 12:12.330
That's not true!

12:12.330 --> 12:13.930
Ichika?

12:13.930 --> 12:16.260
Shimizu passed the exam!

12:17.230 --> 12:21.640
But her family had to move to Tokyo suddenly.

12:28.480 --> 12:31.750
Good for you, Tachibana! I'm so glad!

12:31.750 --> 12:33.750
I hope we're in the same class!

12:33.750 --> 12:35.310
So do I!

12:35.950 --> 12:39.320
I always wanted to wear this school uniform!

12:39.720 --> 12:41.550
They're super cute!

12:45.760 --> 12:46.830
Nao...

12:46.830 --> 12:50.820
I'm fine. It's better not to have gone
to this backwoods school anyway.

12:51.900 --> 12:54.460
There's no place to hang out except the beach.

12:54.770 --> 12:55.970
Say, what?

12:55.970 --> 12:57.400
Satsuki...

13:01.140 --> 13:02.510
Let's go.

13:02.510 --> 13:04.950
I want to get in another swim
before the sun goes down.

13:04.950 --> 13:06.710
Hey, wait!

13:14.860 --> 13:16.050
What a bitch!

13:16.890 --> 13:19.860
Wow, Satsuki! What a kick!

13:35.280 --> 13:36.180
Why?

13:37.150 --> 13:40.170
Dad, why? But, I got in!

13:40.880 --> 13:43.350
I actually got in, and yet...

13:44.220 --> 13:46.410
I got in, damn it!

13:59.330 --> 14:02.240
That's why I didn't want to come.

14:07.510 --> 14:11.140
I didn't want to come back here!

14:22.360 --> 14:26.590
Interfering directly with the children of the trials
is a violation of the rules.

14:28.430 --> 14:30.020
Sorry about this.

14:30.430 --> 14:31.900
Enough of this!

14:32.730 --> 14:35.440
I knew I shouldn't have come!

14:35.440 --> 14:36.670
Shimizu...

14:37.040 --> 14:39.010
Are you okay, Satsuki?

14:39.340 --> 14:41.380
Yeah, I'm fine.

14:41.380 --> 14:43.140
Ichika, where's the watch?

14:45.980 --> 14:48.040
Did you lose it during the confusion?

14:48.520 --> 14:50.550
It... seems like it.

14:50.550 --> 14:52.650
"Seems like it"? That won't cut it.

14:52.650 --> 14:55.120
What's your problem?

14:55.620 --> 14:57.020
Is that watch yours?

14:57.390 --> 14:59.360
No, it's...

14:59.660 --> 15:01.330
It's Ichika's father's.

15:01.330 --> 15:03.160
He let her borrow it for today.

15:03.160 --> 15:05.330
I just have to pay you back for it, right?

15:06.100 --> 15:08.500
No, you don't have to...

15:09.200 --> 15:10.830
I'll pay you back, damn it!

15:14.940 --> 15:16.710
But anyway, what's the deal?

15:16.710 --> 15:19.710
It was an Orga Diver's Master.

15:19.710 --> 15:21.380
They run a couple hundred thousand...

15:23.820 --> 15:28.320
This beach is now closed for the day.

15:28.660 --> 15:32.850
All people still swimming please
come out from the water.

15:41.500 --> 15:42.600
So?

15:42.600 --> 15:44.070
I can't find it.

15:44.070 --> 15:47.040
No matter how much we look,
the sand keeps piling up.

15:54.550 --> 15:57.380
If it's buried in the sand, then it's game over.

15:59.390 --> 16:00.960
This isn't good.

16:00.960 --> 16:04.050
The waves are getting higher,
and the sun is setting.

16:08.660 --> 16:09.560
Nao?

16:13.070 --> 16:16.470
Stop it, Nao... You suck at
swimming to begin with.

16:16.470 --> 16:20.170
Thank you very much.
You've done quite enough.

16:20.510 --> 16:22.410
I think you should give up.

16:22.410 --> 16:24.510
It's quite a ways past closing.

16:24.510 --> 16:26.280
Please, just a little while longer!

17:20.400 --> 17:24.300
Please! I wish to find an important watch!

17:24.310 --> 17:26.640
Please tell me where it is located!

17:26.640 --> 17:27.970
If you can't, then...

17:58.310 --> 18:00.640
I've got to take a breath!

18:07.110 --> 18:08.280
Oh, no!

18:18.030 --> 18:19.960
The Djinn's power is...

18:25.300 --> 18:26.030
Ichika!

18:33.470 --> 18:35.410
Huh? Where's Ichika?

18:36.040 --> 18:37.980
Now that you mention it, they haven't...

18:40.250 --> 18:42.550
Ichika, Manatsu!

18:52.730 --> 18:54.320
Tachibana...

18:56.960 --> 18:58.300
Shimizu...

18:59.870 --> 19:03.200
I found the watch, so...

19:03.200 --> 19:04.300
Don't worry about...

19:07.410 --> 19:09.240
I won't apologize.

19:09.740 --> 19:12.880
It's your fault for wearing something so valuable.

19:12.880 --> 19:14.010
Say, what?!

19:14.020 --> 19:15.280
It's okay!

19:15.620 --> 19:17.210
But, Ichika...

19:17.590 --> 19:19.020
It's okay.

19:21.460 --> 19:24.830
And that's how everything was resolved.

19:24.830 --> 19:30.560
But for me, I was left with a strangely
bitter feeling with everyone.

19:31.030 --> 19:32.630
That makes three.

19:33.200 --> 19:35.100
Nine are left.

19:36.540 --> 19:41.040
The train platform I'm used to passing through...

19:42.910 --> 19:47.750
When I glanced

19:50.450 --> 19:54.950
I could not help but feel like

19:56.520 --> 19:59.090
All my changing friends were dazzling

19:59.090 --> 20:00.730
Let's go home, Ichika!
All my changing friends were dazzling

20:00.730 --> 20:01.100
Let's go home, Ichika!

20:01.100 --> 20:02.960
Keiko and Michiru have already left.

20:03.500 --> 20:08.000
I have no words left in my body

20:10.540 --> 20:13.870
The sudden loneliness, tightens around my heart

20:13.870 --> 20:16.380
You shouldn't get so mad.
