Each time I protect one thing important to me

20:55.750 --> 20:56.250
Do I begin to lose something?

20:56.250 --> 20:59.520
I'll be working here the whole summer.
Do I begin to lose something?

20:59.520 --> 21:00.820
Do I begin to lose something?

21:00.820 --> 21:03.290
Yeah. I'll come again.
Do I begin to lose something?

