21:26.780 --> 21:26.910
Ichika dear, your father is calling you!

21:26.910 --> 21:29.780
Ichika dear, your father is calling you!
If you had noticed them sooner...

21:29.780 --> 21:30.350
Coming!
If you had noticed them sooner...

21:30.350 --> 21:33.620
If you had noticed them sooner...

21:42.360 --> 21:47.630


21:47.700 --> 21:50.670


