23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

23:20.660 --> 23:20.690


23:20.690 --> 23:21.830


23:21.830 --> 23:24.430
The hope of becoming a person like that,

23:25.370 --> 23:27.770
and the ties that ensnare those that cross paths.

23:28.770 --> 23:35.110
